OL,3,AAsos says customers' personal
OL,4,Ainformation 'may have been accessed'
OL,5,Aafter message from apparent hackers
OL,6,
OL,7,FAsos says it is "investigating
OL,8,Funauthorised activity" after customers
OL,9,Freceived a pop-up message from apparent
OL,10,Fhackers
OL,12,F"Basic personal information including
OL,13,Fname and contact details may have been
OL,14,Faccessed," the retailer says, adding it
OL,15,Fdoesn't believe payment information or
OL,16,Faccount passwords were impacted
OL,18,FThe notification - sent earlier to app
OL,19,Fusers - said: "Dear Asos DPO and IT, we
OL,20,Fhave fully compromised the Snowflake
OL,21,Finstance. Engage with us, or we will
OL,22,Fleak it"
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
