OL,3,AAsos says customers' personal
OL,4,Ainformation 'may have been accessed'
OL,5,Aafter message from apparent hackers
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn Asos customer told us they were
OL,8,F"scared to go into" the retailer's app
OL,9,Fas a result. Another, Jodie from
OL,10,FEdinburgh, said she initially thought
OL,11,Fthe message was "an ad or fun
OL,12,Fpromotion"
OL,14,FDid you get the notification? Here's
OL,15,Fwhat you should do
